    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>36</mn><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>53</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math><br />&nbsp;<br />angle rotated should be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>53</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>37</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></math></p>",
